      "proposition": "The Court will hold that the plaintiff's claim presents a new Bivens context because the factual circumstances (a prison gang fight injury rather than an asthma attack) differ meaningfully from Carlson v. Green, and that the BOP's administrative grievance program is an alternative remedial structure that constitutes a special factor counseling hesitation."
